    ["你是那个莱斯马戏团的？"] = "Вы из того самого цирка Лайс?",
    ["非凡者可以在他人信息界面查看其他非凡者与自己的匹配分数，以及对方的个人信息。\n非凡者可以对对方点击喜欢，点击后会向对方发起好友请求，如果双方互相点击喜欢，双方会成为好友并且互相进入<Highlight>誓约池</>。\n非凡者也可直接点击占卜下一个，那么当前的非凡者会被标记为无感，后续该非凡者再次被推荐的优先级会降低。\n非凡者可以在祈誓主界面点击<Highlight>占卜记录</>按钮，点击后可打开占卜记录界面，非凡者可以在此查看当天占卜的非凡者的情况，非凡者可以通过点击占卜记录页面的爱心按钮，将未标记为喜欢的非凡者标记为喜欢状态（已经处于喜欢状态的玩家无法修改为无感状态）。\n占卜记录每天<Highlight>早上8点</>清空。"] = "Потусторонние могут просматривать баллы совпадения с другими Потусторонними и их личную информацию на экране информации о другом игроке.\nПотусторонний может нажать «Нравится» в отношении другого игрока — после этого другому игроку будет отправлен запрос в друзья. Если оба игрока нажмут «Нравится» друг другу, они станут друзьями и попадут друг к другу в <Highlight>Пул Клятвы</>.\nПотусторонний также может сразу нажать «Следующее гадание» — тогда текущий Потусторонний будет отмечен как «Нет чувств», и приоритет его повторной рекомендации в будущем снизится.\nПотусторонний может нажать кнопку <Highlight>Записи гаданий</> на главном экране Клятвы, чтобы открыть экран записей гаданий, где можно посмотреть, кто был показан в гаданиях за день. Нажав на кнопку сердечка на странице записей гаданий, можно отметить как «Нравится» тех Потусторонних, которые ещё не были так отмечены (игроков, уже отмеченных как «Нравится», нельзя изменить на статус «Нет чувств»).\nЗаписи гаданий очищаются каждый день в <Highlight>8:00 утра</>.",
    ["How can what we have compare to the research they are doing!"] = "Куда нам сравниться с их исследованиями!",
    ["I've been cursed! I can't get up from the ground, only a true love's kiss can break it!"] = "Меня прокляли! Я не могу подняться с земли, только поцелуй истинной любви может снять проклятие!",
    ["……In any case, I cannot leave a Beyonder creature wandering outside."] = "...В любом случае, я не могу позволить потустороннему существу бродить на свободе.",
    ["<HighLight>[%s]</> has officially started the 'Celebrity Feast' event, all Beyonders are welcome to participate!"] = "<HighLight>[%s]</> официально открывает мероприятие «Пир знаменитостей». Приглашаем всех Потусторонних!",
    ["窥秘人-肉鸽BD-星沙突击"] = "Подглядывающий в тайны — Rogue BD — Звёздный песчаный штурм",
    ["<h>离开咖啡厅</>"] = "<h>Leave the Cafe</>",
    ["<Title>巨龙现身</>\n战略服终末猎杀的巨龙讨伐于<Highlight>每周四、周六20:00—20:45</>开放。巨龙·投影在活动开启<Highlight>1分钟后</>，即<Highlight>20:01</>，现身<Highlight>猎龙城王城中心</>。若20:45前未被击退，巨龙将离开，且不触发击杀结算。\n\n<Title>分线人数</>\n每个战区常驻开放<Highlight>2条分线</>，每条分线中，单个势力最多<Highlight>160名玩家</>，单条分线总人数最多<Highlight>640人</>。\n\n<Title>势力归属伤害</>\n仅在巨龙周围<Highlight>40米</>内存活并对其造成伤害时，伤害才会计入玩家当前所属势力。同势力不同团队的伤害合并累计。巨龙被击退时，<Highlight>当前累计有效归属伤害最高的势力</>获得最终归属。靠近巨龙后，可实时查看当前势力的归属伤害。\n\n<Title>伤害衰减</>\n玩家死亡、离开巨龙讨伐范围或切换分线后，该玩家已为势力累计的归属伤害将开始衰减，并同步影响势力当前的有效归属伤害。\n\n触发衰减后的<Highlight>前5秒</>，归属伤害保持不变；从第6秒开始，<Highlight>每6秒减少原累计归属伤害的5%</>，持续120秒后归零。\n\n重新进入<Highlight>巨龙讨伐范围</>并恢复参战后，衰减停止。当前剩余的归属伤害将被保留，并在此基础上继续累计新造成的伤害。\n\n<Title>势力拍卖</>\n<Highlight>两条分线的巨龙全部被击败后</>，根据各势力取得最终归属的巨龙数量，于<Highlight>每周四、周六21:20—21:49</>开启对应档位的猎龙势力拍卖（21:20—21:30准备，21:30—21:49竞拍）。同一势力取得<Highlight>两条巨龙</>的最终归属，可开启更丰厚的拍卖奖励。玩家在活动期间参与，即可获得拍卖资格和分红奖励。\n\n<Title>资格限制</>\n每次终末猎杀活动中，每名玩家至多获得<Highlight>1次</>巨龙·投影的拍卖资格；已取得资格的玩家，本次活动内无法再次取得。\n\n<Title>参与奖励</>\n玩家当前所在分线的巨龙被击败时，结算参与奖励。奖励根据玩家所在势力对该巨龙造成的伤害占其总血量的百分比，按已达成的<Highlight>最高档位</>结算，并在讨伐结束后通过邮件发放。\n\n每名玩家每次讨伐巨龙活动最多结算<Highlight>1次参与奖励</>。完成结算后，即使切换分线继续参与讨伐，也不会再次结算。\n\n<Title>神选积分</>\n巨龙被击退并确定最终归属后，获胜势力中<Highlight>符合资格的俱乐部</>可获得<Highlight>300点神选积分</>。每个俱乐部每次讨伐巨龙活动最多可获得<Highlight>2次</>神选积分奖励。"] = "<Title>Dragon Appearance</>\nThe Strategic Server Final Hunt Giant Dragon crusade is open <Highlight>every Thursday and Saturday from 20:00—20:45</>. Dragon - Projection appears at the <Highlight>center of the Dragon-Hunting City Royal City</> <Highlight>1 minute after</> the event starts, i.e., at <Highlight>20:01</>. If it is not repelled before 20:45, the Giant Dragon will leave, and no kill settlement will be triggered.\n\n<Title>Channel Population</>\nEach theater has <Highlight>2 permanent channels</> open. In each channel, a single faction can have at most <Highlight>160 players</>, and the total population per channel is at most <Highlight>640 people</>.\n\n<Title>Faction Ownership Damage</>\nDamage is only counted toward the player's current faction if they are alive and dealing damage within <Highlight>40 meters</> of the Giant Dragon. Damage from different teams within the same faction is combined and accumulated. When the Giant Dragon is repelled, the <Highlight>faction with the highest current accumulated effective ownership damage</> gains final ownership. You can view the current faction's ownership damage in real-time after approaching the Giant Dragon.\n\n<Title>Damage Decay</>\nAfter a player dies, leaves the Giant Dragon crusade range, or switches channels, the ownership damage that player has accumulated for the faction will begin to decay, simultaneously affecting the faction's current effective ownership damage.\n\nFor the <Highlight>first 5 seconds</> after decay is triggered, ownership damage remains unchanged; starting from the 6th second, <Highlight>5% of the original accumulated ownership damage is reduced every 6 seconds</>, reaching zero after 120 seconds.\n\nUpon re-entering the <Highlight>Giant Dragon crusade range</> and resuming combat, the decay stops. The currently remaining ownership damage will be retained, and new damage dealt will continue to accumulate on this basis.\n\n<Title>Faction Auction</>\n<Highlight>After the Giant Dragons in both channels are defeated</>, a Dragon-Hunting Faction Auction corresponding to the tier is opened <Highlight>every Thursday and Saturday from 21:20—21:49</> (21:20—21:30 preparation, 21:30—21:49 bidding). If the same faction obtains final ownership of <Highlight>two Giant Dragons</>, more generous auction rewards can be opened. Players who participate during the event can obtain auction qualifications and dividend rewards.\n\n<Title>Qualification Restrictions</>\nIn each Final Hunt event, each player can obtain at most <Highlight>1</> qualification for the Dragon - Projection auction; players who have already obtained the qualification cannot obtain it again during this event.\n\n<Title>Participation Rewards</>\nWhen the Giant Dragon in the player's current channel is defeated, participation rewards are settled. Rewards are settled based on the percentage of the Giant Dragon's total HP dealt by the player's faction, according to the <Highlight>highest tier achieved</>, and will be sent via mail after the crusade ends.\n\nEach player can receive at most <Highlight>1 participation reward</> per Giant Dragon crusade event. Once settlement is complete, even if you switch channels to continue participating in the crusade, you will not be settled again.\n\n<Title>God-Chosen Points</>\nAfter the Giant Dragon is repelled and final ownership is determined, <Highlight>eligible clubs</> in the winning faction can receive <Highlight>300 God-Chosen Points</>. Each club can receive at most <Highlight>2</> God-Chosen Point rewards per Giant Dragon crusade event.",
